  "description": "Convert an integer to its base 7 string representation.",
  "target": "100",
  "pseudocode": "1: let n = Math.abs(num)\n2: let res = ''\n3: while n > 0\n4:   res = (n % 7) + res\n5:   n = Math.floor(n / 7)\n6: return num < 0 ? '-' + res : res",
